  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Dark Circles</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><strong>What it is: </strong> A lightweight non-comedogenic concealer with natural radiant medium coverage clinically proven to wear 12 hours, smooth, and hydrate skin. <br><br><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium<br><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Natural <br><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Cream <br><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Niacinamide: Soothes, conditions, evens, and brightens the appearance of skin. <br>- Hyaluronic Acid: Attracts and binds moisture to smooth and hydrate skin. <br>- Glycerin: A fatty acid known to increase skin’s natural moisture level. <br> <br><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil,</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Clean and prep skin as you normally would. Saie recommends starting with Glowy Super Gel and Slip Tint SPF 35 Tinted Moisturizer (both sold separately) to get a sheer, hydrated, dewy base. <br>-Using the doe-foot applicator, apply desired amount to conceal dark circles, imperfections, redness, or anywhere you need medium coverage to even out your complexion. A little goes a long way.<br>-Use your fingertips or The Double Brush (sold separately) to gently tap and blend Slip Tint Concealer until it melts into skin.<br><br>Saie's Artistry Tip:<br>- Use the small end of The Double Brush for targeted areas<br>- Use the large end for all over evenness.<br><br><b>Recycling Instructions:<br></b>-While Slip Tint's components are made of recyclable materials, individual components under two inches do not typically make it through the home recycling stream. To ensure your empties get recycled, recycle through Pact Collective via saiehello.com or in store at select Sephora locations.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Niacinamide: Soothes, conditions, evens, and brightens the appearance of skin. <br>-Hyaluronic Acid: Attracts and binds moisture to smooth and hydrate skin. <br>-Glycerin: A fatty acid known to increase skin&rsquo;s natural moisture level.<br><br>Aqua / Water / Eau, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Glycerin, C13-15 Alkane, Dicaprylyl Ether, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, Lauroyl Lysine, Mica, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Polyglyceryl-6 Polyhydroxystearate, Polyglyceryl-6 Polyricinoleate, Silica, Sodium Chloride, Sodium Hyaluronate, Niacinamide, Polyglutamic Acid, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Extract, Emblica Officinalis Fruit Extract (Amla), Althaea Officinalis Root Extract (Marshmallow), Tocopherol, Polyglycerin-6, Glyceryl Caprylate, Caprylhydroxamic Acid, Trihydroxystearin, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Ascorbyl Palmitate, Titanium, Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Dark Circles</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Medium Coverage</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><strong>What it is: </strong> A lightweight non-comedogenic concealer with natural radiant medium coverage clinically proven to wear 12 hours, smooth, and hydrate skin. <br><br><strong>Coverage: </strong>Medium<br><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Natural <br><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Cream <br><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Niacinamide: Soothes, conditions, evens, and brightens the appearance of skin. <br>- Hyaluronic Acid: Attracts and binds moisture to smooth and hydrate skin. <br>- Glycerin: A fatty acid known to increase skin’s natural moisture level. <br> <br><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil,</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Clean and prep skin as you normally would. Saie recommends starting with Glowy Super Gel and Slip Tint SPF 35 Tinted Moisturizer (both sold separately) to get a sheer, hydrated, dewy base. <br>-Using the doe-foot applicator, apply desired amount to conceal dark circles, imperfections, redness, or anywhere you need medium coverage to even out your complexion. A little goes a long way.<br>-Use your fingertips or The Double Brush (sold separately) to gently tap and blend Slip Tint Concealer until it melts into skin.<br><br>Saie's Artistry Tip:<br>- Use the small end of The Double Brush for targeted areas<br>- Use the large end for all over evenness.<br><br><b>Recycling Instructions:<br></b>-While Slip Tint's components are made of recyclable materials, individual components under two inches do not typically make it through the home recycling stream. To ensure your empties get recycled, recycle through Pact Collective via saiehello.com or in store at select Sephora locations.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Niacinamide: Soothes, conditions, evens, and brightens the appearance of skin. <br>-Hyaluronic Acid: Attracts and binds moisture to smooth and hydrate skin. <br>-Glycerin: A fatty acid known to increase skin&rsquo;s natural moisture level.<br><br>Aqua / Water / Eau, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Glycerin, C13-15 Alkane, Dicaprylyl Ether, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, Lauroyl Lysine, Mica, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Polyglyceryl-6 Polyhydroxystearate, Polyglyceryl-6 Polyricinoleate, Silica, Sodium Chloride, Sodium Hyaluronate, Niacinamide, Polyglutamic Acid, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Extract, Emblica Officinalis Fruit Extract (Amla), Althaea Officinalis Root Extract (Marshmallow), Tocopherol, Polyglycerin-6, Glyceryl Caprylate, Caprylhydroxamic Acid, Trihydroxystearin, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Ascorbyl Palmitate, Titanium, Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
